"}],"gloss":"like that which rose"},{"surface":"கட்டூர்","parts":[{"text":"கட்டு","lemma":"kaṭṭu","gloss":"fortified"},{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ūr","gloss":"town/camp"}],"gloss":"army camp"},{"surface":"நாப்பண்","parts":[{"text":"நாப்பண்","lemma":"nāppaṇ","gloss":"middle"}],"gloss":"middle"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெந்து","parts":[{"text":"வெந்து","lemma":"ventu","gloss":"having burned/raged"}],"gloss":"having burned with anger"},{"surface":"வாய்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"vāy","gloss":"mouth/lips"}],"gloss":"mouth/lips"},{"surface":"மடித்து","parts":[{"text":"மடி","lemma":"maṭi","gloss":"to fold/bite"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"உ","lemma":"u","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having bitten/folded"},{"surface":"வேல்","parts":[{"text":"வேல்","lemma":"vēl","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"spear"},{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"head/tip"}],"gloss":"head/tip"},{"surface":"பெயரி","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்","lemma":"peyar","gloss":"to move/turn"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having turned/moved"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தோடு","parts":[{"text":"தோடு","lemma":"tōṭu","gloss":"crowd/group"}],"gloss":"crowd of soldiers"},{"surface":"உகைத்து","parts":[{"text":"உகை","lemma":"ukai","gloss":"to drive/dispatch"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"உ","lemma":"u","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having driven"},{"surface":"எழுதரூஉ","parts":[{"text":"எழுதரூஉ","lemma":"எழுதரூஉ","gloss":"rising up"}],"gloss":"rising up","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துரந்து","parts":[{"text":"துர","lemma":"tura","gloss":"to chase/drive"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"n","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having chased"},{"surface":"எறி","parts":[{"text":"எறி","lemma":"eṟi","gloss":"to strike/throw"}],"gloss":"striking"},{"surface":"ஞாட்பின்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாட்பு","lemma":"ñāṭpu","gloss":"battle"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"locative case suffix"}],"gloss":"in the battle"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வரு","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"to come"}],"gloss":"oncoming"},{"surface":"படை","parts":[{"text":"படை","lemma":"paṭai","gloss":"army"}],"gloss":"army"},{"surface":"போழ்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"போழ்","lemma":"pōḻ","gloss":"to cleave/split"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"n","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having cleaved"},{"surface":"வாய்ப்பட","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"vāy","gloss":"place/chance"},{"text":"பட","lemma":"paṭa","gloss":"to happen/fall"}],"gloss":"so as to fall"},{"surface":"விலங்கி","parts":[{"text":"விலங்கு","lemma":"vilaṅku","gloss":"to block/obstruct"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having blocked"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இடைப்","parts":[{"text":"இடைப்","lemma":"இடைப்","gloss":"middle"}],"gloss":"middle","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"படை","parts":[{"text":"படை","lemma":"paṭai","gloss":"army"}],"gloss":"army"},{"surface":"அழுவத்து","parts":[{"text":"அழுவத்து","lemma":"அழுவத்து","gloss":"in the expanse"}],"gloss":"in the expanse","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிதைந்து","parts":[{"text":"சிதை","lemma":"citai","gloss":"to be destroyed"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"n","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having been shattered"},{"surface":"வேறாகிய","parts":[{"text":"வேறு","lemma":"vēṟu","gloss":"different/separated"},{"text":"ஆகிய","lemma":"ākiya","gloss":"that became"}],"gloss":"that became separated"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சிறப்பு","parts":[{"text":"சிறப்பு","lemma":"ciṟappu","gloss":"excellence/distinction"}],"gloss":"distinction"},{"surface":"உடையாளன்","parts":[{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"to possess"},{"text":"ஆளன்","lemma":"āḷaṉ","gloss":"he who possesses"}],"gloss":"he who possesses"},{"surface":"மாண்பு","parts":[{"text":"மாண்பு","lemma":"māṇpu","gloss":"greatness/glory"}],"gloss":"greatness"},{"surface":"கண்டு","parts":[{"text":"கண்டு","lemma":"கண்டு","gloss":"having seen"}],"gloss":"having seen","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அருவி","parts":[{"text":"அருவி","lemma":"aruvi","gloss":"waterfall"}],"gloss":"like a waterfall"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாடு","parts":[{"text":"வாடு","lemma":"vāṭu","gloss":"to wither"}],"gloss":"withered"},{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"malai","gloss":"mountain (here a typo for breast 'mulai')"}],"gloss":"breasts (written as mountain)"},{"surface":"ஊறி","parts":[{"text":"ஊறு","lemma":"ūṟu","gloss":"to secrete/flow"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having secreted"},{"surface":"சுரந்தன","parts":[{"text":"சுரந்தன","lemma":"சுரந்தன","gloss":"they flowed"}],"gloss":"they flowed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓடாப்","parts":[{"text":"ஓடாப்","lemma":"ஓடாப்","gloss":"non-retreating"}],"gloss":"non-retreating","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பூட்கை","parts":[{"text":"பூட்கை","lemma":"pūṭkai","gloss":"determination/strength"}],"gloss":"determination"},{"surface":"விடலை","parts":[{"text":"விடலை","lemma":"viṭalai","gloss":"young hero"}],"gloss":"young hero"},{"surface":"தாய்க்கே","parts":[{"text":"தாய்","lemma":"tāy","gloss":"mother"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"kku","gloss":"dative case suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"to the mother indeed"}]}],"literal":"In the middle of the army camp that rose like the ocean, / burning with anger, biting his lips, turning his spearhead, / driving the crowd of soldiers, rising up, chasing and striking in the battle, / cleaving the oncoming army, blocking them to fall, / in the expanse of the middle army, being destroyed and separated, / having seen the greatness of the distinguished hero, like a waterfall, / the withered breasts (written as mountain) secreted, flowing with milk, / for the mother of the young hero of non-retreating determination!","translation":"In the middle of the army camp that rose like the swelling ocean, burning with anger, biting his lips, and turning his spearhead, he drove the crowd of soldiers, rose up, and chased and struck them in battle. Cleaving the oncoming army and blocking them so they fell, he stood in the expanse of the middle army, destroyed and cut to pieces. Seeing the glorious greatness of this distinguished hero, the withered breasts of the mother of this young warrior of non-retreating determination swelled and secreted milk like a waterfall!","modern":"கடல் போலக் கிளர்ந்து எழுந்த பாசறையின் நடுவே, சினத்தால் வெந்து உதட்டைக் கடித்து, தன் வேலின் முனையைத் திருப்பி, பகைவர் கூட்டத்தைச் செலுத்தி, எழுந்து வந்து, துரத்தி அடிக்கும் போர்க்களத்தில், எதிர்த்து வரும் படையைப் பிளந்து, அவர்கள் மடியுமாறு தடுத்து, இடைப்படையின் பரப்பில் தானும் சிதைந்து துண்டு துண்டாகி வீழ்ந்த சிறப்புடைய அவ்வீரனின் பெருமையைக் கண்டு, பின்வாங்காத மனவலிமை கொண்ட அந்த இளைஞனின் தாய்க்கு, வற்றிய அவளது முலைகள் நீர்வீழ்ச்சி போலப் பால் சுரந்தன.","explanation":"The poet Avvaiyār describes the heroic death of a young warrior in the tumpai tiṇai (battle of strength) and the pride of his mother. The scene is set in the middle of a vast army camp that resembles a roaring ocean. The young hero fights fiercely, biting his lips in anger, turning his spear, and cleaving through the enemy ranks until he is cut to pieces in the thick of the battle. Upon seeing her son's glorious and heroic end on the battlefield, the mother's withered breasts miraculously secrete milk like a flowing waterfall. This powerful image of 'joyful weeping' (uvakaik kaluḻcci) highlights the supreme value placed on martial valour and maternal pride in classical Tamil society. Key words include 'kaṭṭūr' (army camp), 'ñāṭpiṉ' (battle), 'viṭalai' (young hero), and 'tāy' (mother).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.9],[2.9,3.2],[3.28,3.76],[3.76,4.1],[4.1,5.22],[5.47,5.59],[5.59,5.59],[5.59,5.59],[5.59,5.59],[5.59,6.2],[6.24,6.28],[6.3,9.1],[9.1,10.5],[10.5,10.5],[10.5,10.9],[10.9,11.0],[11.0,12.5],[12.5,12.5],[12.5,13.2],[13.83,14.7],[14.7,14.7],[14.7,14.7],[14.7,15.2],[15.2,16.1],[16.1,16.3],[16.3,16.6],[16.6,16.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,1.7],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,3.4],[3.4,3.7],[3.8,4.48],[4.48,4.72],[5.0,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,7.5],[7.5,7.8],[7.8,8.29],[8.29,8.53],[8.53,9.71],[9.71,10.36],[10.57,10.79],[10.79,11.0],[11.0,12.3],[12.3,12.3],[12.3,13.8],[13.8,13.8],[13.8,14.8],[14.8,15.2],[15.2,15.2],[15.2,15.2],[15.2,15.2],[15.2,18.1],[18.1,18.2],[18.2,18.6],[18.6,18.8]]}}